GNU nano, the small friendly terminal text editor.
Built with UTF-8 support on the wide-char ncurses, without translations, the spell checker and libmagic. The sample
syntax files are installed in /usr/local/share/nano; to turn highlighting on, add
include "/usr/local/share/nano/*.nanorc" to /etc/nanorc or ~/.nanorc.
